  ('acc-equipment', 'tools=provided', '{"tools":"provided"}'::jsonb, 'Assemble mobility or home equipment', 'Assemble the free-standing equipment from its instructions. Hand tools are provided.', 'Assembly of free-standing equipment and clearing the packaging. Use of the provided hand tools.', 'No personal or medical care, no physically supporting a person''s weight, and no decisions made on the person''s behalf. No fixing anything to walls, no grab rails, and no equipment a professional must fit.', 'The equipment is assembled, stable, and the person confirms it suits them.', 'access', 'Accessibility', 60, 34, array['paid', 'community', 'sponsored']::text[], false),
